[6403.321912, "o", "  1050\t            free(r); free(r0); free(pvec); free(v); free(s); free(t); free(z);\r\n  1051\t            die(\"BiCGSTAB numerical breakdown\");\r\n  1052\t        }\r\n  1053\t        double omega = ts / tt;\r\n  1054\t        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\r\n  1055\t            x[i] += alpha * z[i] + omega * s[i];\r\n  1056\t            r[i] = s[i] - omega * t[i];\r\n  1057\t"]
