[6690.396776, "o", "   997\t            free(r); free(z); free(pvec); free(Ap);\r\n   998\t            break;\r\n   999\t        }\r\n  1000\t        double beta = rz_new / rz_old;\r\n  1001\t        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) pvec[i] = z[i] + beta * pvec[i];\r\n  1002\t        rz_old = rz_new;\r\n  1003\t    }\r\n  1004\t\r\n  1005\t    if (iterations_out) *iterations_out = it_count;\r\n  1006\t    free(r); free(z); free(pvec); free(Ap);\r\n  1007\t    return x;\r\n  1008\t}\r\n"]
